{"id":100138,"slug":"100138-export-vai-trieu-document-ra-ngoai-nen-dung-cach-nao","category":"Elasticsearch","subcategory":"Search","level":"advanced","question_vi":"Export vài triệu document ra ngoài nên dùng cách nào?","question_en":"What is the right way to export a few million documents?","answer_vi":"`point_in_time` + `search_after`. Đây là cách được khuyến nghị hiện nay; `scroll` API là cách cũ và đã bị deprecate cho use case này.\n\n```bash\nPOST /products/_pit?keep_alive=5m\n# -> {\"id\": \"46ToAwMD...\"}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"size\": 1000,\n  \"pit\": { \"id\": \"46ToAwMD...\", \"keep_alive\": \"5m\" },\n  \"sort\":","answer_en":"`point_in_time` plus `search_after`. This is the current recommendation; the `scroll` API is the older approach and is deprecated for this use case.\n\n```bash\nPOST /products/_pit?keep_alive=5m\n# -> {\"id\": \"46ToAwMD...\"}\n```\n\n```json\n{\n  \"size\": 1000,\n  \"pit\": { \"id\": \"46ToAwMD...\", \"keep_alive\": \"5m\" },\n  \"sort\":","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\"><code>point_in_time</code> + <code>search_after</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Đây là cách được khuyến nghị hiện nay; <code>scroll</code> API là cách cũ và đã bị deprecate cho use case này.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"POST /products/_pit?keep_alive=5m\n# -&gt; {&quot;id&quot;: &quot;46ToAwMD...&quot;}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">POST /products/_pit?keep_alive=5m\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># -&gt; {&quot;id&quot;: &quot;46ToAwMD...&quot;}</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"{\n  &quot;size&quot;: 1000,\n  &quot;pit&quot;: { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;46ToAwMD...&quot;, &quot;keep_alive&quot;: &quot;5m&quot; },\n  &quot;sort&quot;:","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\"><code>point_in_time</code> plus <code>search_after</code>.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">This is the current recommendation; the <code>scroll</code> API is the older approach and is deprecated for this use case.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"POST /products/_pit?keep_alive=5m\n# -&gt; {&quot;id&quot;: &quot;46ToAwMD...&quot;}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">POST /products/_pit?keep_alive=5m\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># -&gt; {&quot;id&quot;: &quot;46ToAwMD...&quot;}</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">json</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"{\n  &quot;size&quot;: 1000,\n  &quot;pit&quot;: { &quot;id&quot;: &quot;46ToAwMD...&quot;, &quot;keep_alive&quot;: &quot;5m&quot; },\n  &quot;sort&quot;:","references":[{"label":"Elastic — Point in time API","url":"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/point-in-time-api.html"},{"label":"Elastic — Paginate search results","url":"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/current/paginate-search-results.html"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/100111-vi-sao-from-size-bi-gioi-han-o-10-000-va-thay-bang-gi","title":"Vì sao `from`/`size` bị giới hạn ở 10.000 và thay bằng gì?"},{"url":"/q/100120-lam-autocomplete-goi-y-khi-go-nen-dung-cach-nao","title":"Làm autocomplete (gợi ý khi gõ) nên dùng cách nào?"},{"url":"/q/100121-highlight-tu-khoa-trong-ket-qua-nen-lam-o-server-hay-client","title":"Highlight từ khoá trong kết quả nên làm ở server hay client?"},{"url":"/q/100101-inverted-index-la-gi-va-vi-sao-no-lam-full-text-search-nhanh","title":"Inverted index là gì và vì sao nó làm full-text search nhanh?"},{"url":"/q/100102-shard-va-replica-khac-nhau-the-nao-chon-so-shard-bao-nhieu","title":"Shard và replica khác nhau thế nào? Chọn số shard bao nhiêu?"},{"url":"/q/100103-text-va-keyword-khac-nhau-ra-sao-khi-nao-dung-cai-nao","title":"`text` và `keyword` khác nhau ra sao? Khi nào dùng cái nào?"},{"url":"/q/100104-analyzer-gom-nhung-thanh-phan-nao-va-vi-sao-phai-hieu-no","title":"Analyzer gồm những thành phần nào và vì sao phải hiểu nó?"},{"url":"/q/100105-match-va-term-khac-nhau-the-nao-vi-sao-term-hay-tra-ve-rong","title":"`match` và `term` khác nhau thế nào? Vì sao `term` hay trả về rỗng?"}]}